                <divLine xml:id="m-4d3c0674-0119-485b-bc02-56f454a95c6a" facs="#m-12eb6d64-fac5-482e-960b-eb976e27dfdc" form="finalis" />
              </layer>
            </staff>
            <div xml:id="m-fca48ff7-d0fc-4d8e-8ac4-9c8f014b9b39">
              <lg xml:id="m-c5fb6e16-c329-4a52-b72a-19700ddaad57">
                <l xml:id="m-38bfaccb-4a3f-462c-86f1-f2ccbb232509" facs="#m-a02282a1-32a7-47fe-8800-2026f1d5bd26" label="text-like">1230 Common of a Virgin not a Martyr. Mass II.</l><l xml:id="m-573ccf3e-17bb-4397-a9e5-8ac8a855a3a3" facs="#m-899fdc39-2bbb-4013-9f03-947e05fcf525" label="ambiguous">Lectio Epistolae beati Pauli Apostoli ad Corinthios. 1. Cor. 7. c.</l><l xml:id="m-214729c1-d9ef-4b66-b88f-a8a67b0930ea" facs="#m-40cc850d-231b-4de0-b88c-dbdd12dabfb7" label="lyrics-like">LRatres: De virgínibus praecé- tamquam non habéntes sint: et</l><l xml:id="m-5db74295-40d1-4995-ab11-1c2d90272896" facs="#m-abd68b82-326e-4553-b99b-356a9f81bbe6" label="lyrics-like">Lptum Dómini non hábeo, con¬</l><l xml:id="m-4fd45524-d78c-431f-8305-621c3616222f" facs="#m-0f43a4e3-023e-428c-9976-a82ce1ce761f" label="ambiguous">qui flent, tamquam non flentes: et</l><l xml:id="m-4cb30d28-5de1-4e3e-8ecc-2bb01401ff25" facs="#m-29c20c00-8838-498e-8cf6-06fb273dd28a" label="ambiguous">sllium autem do, tamquam miseri¬</l><l xml:id="m-920b09b9-6762-4218-adb3-8d0f7b9ee64b" facs="#m-653520f9-7248-4de6-a91e-a602fd4ecc97" label="ambiguous">qui gaudent, tamquam non gau¬</l><l xml:id="m-2952dcc2-d145-4f9d-bbd9-940bf6a44df4" facs="#m-bc6dcf55-7808-4b15-927f-dc124e8b47e5" label="lyrics-like">córdiam consecútus a Dómino, ut</l><l xml:id="m-8ae7f51b-f5db-4509-bc62-abe584fc058a" facs="#m-9da8786c-26b9-48cd-9dfd-fe5733878baf" label="lyrics-like">déntes: et qui emunt, tamquam</l><l xml:id="m-aacd89e9-6e58-48c6-8291-535d83cfa8d5" facs="#m-8032a012-2493-4222-b9fe-256d27b2b066" label="lyrics-like">sim fidélis. Exístimo ergo hoc bo¬</l><l xml:id="m-d76e2714-5152-4555-a14b-5a41b522b2f0" facs="#m-e9cdcdbc-77b3-40e2-b005-28cf701a5e5b" label="lyrics-like">non possidéntes: et qui utúntur</l><l xml:id="m-cc3251c9-7c65-4a83-a670-6c35872b3347" facs="#m-1f1bb9d5-5ed7-4bd8-9688-f0be883f4c04" label="lyrics-like">num esse propter instántem neces¬</l><l xml:id="m-2fb0fc16-795a-4f55-a889-d1f7c5e0ded9" facs="#m-3a77a81a-c4ef-4f34-83b3-f80e55d6e865" label="lyrics-like">hoc mundo, tamquam non utántur:</l><l xml:id="m-30afe948-a909-4d83-877b-4d7b64c4ec74" facs="#m-b944988c-1cc9-4c7a-a596-07fac7f889c2" label="lyrics-like">praéterit enim figúra hujus mundi.</l><l xml:id="m-d1d84d4a-9df0-4972-85ee-2124dad15fce" facs="#m-b3624ab6-a439-4842-ac85-f926239c3468" label="lyrics-like">sitátem, quóniam bonum est hó¬</l><l xml:id="m-f1d7200f-d94f-49ba-b5af-ff404db37d91" facs="#m-5c9c5f64-38f3-45c5-b3dc-ff3d55b8cbe2" label="lyrics-like">Volo autem vos sine sollicitúdine</l><l xml:id="m-fb669af2-23bb-4939-8cfe-cc9bc91345f4" facs="#m-f3dcb072-8cc5-44c6-ba67-b50fe00eedc2" label="lyrics-like">mini sic esse. Alligátus es uxóri?</l><l xml:id="m-3b5ebedc-53c4-4433-a1e8-d6bc6fe0b55e" facs="#m-b58fa721-9b39-4755-ae7d-71503e375db0" label="lyrics-like">esse. Qui sine uxóre est, sollícitus</l><l xml:id="m-6ffd2de2-fae1-477f-b19d-1595a2d995eb" facs="#m-3bdf822e-8285-43f8-a5a3-0138e724a456" label="lyrics-like">noli quaérere solutiónem. Solútus</l><l xml:id="m-fe5d5e3c-fea6-4a01-b185-faf3c3e3cdf6" facs="#m-ab611a99-a58c-43d8-8572-7e04c3102abd" label="lyrics-like">est quae Dómini sunt, quómodo</l><l xml:id="m-bad43423-e4f0-4ec9-ba06-3952d6b86191" facs="#m-714b2a12-51f3-4721-8081-8e33b0cc1209" label="lyrics-like">es ab uxóre? noli quaérere uxórem.</l><l xml:id="m-19b2face-7ca2-42bf-8598-4247cdfcf592" facs="#m-08e7ea34-7825-46b8-bc27-d2493784562a" label="lyrics-like">si autem accéperis uxórem, non</l><l xml:id="m-40eae24e-a365-48f5-b50c-ecdb3b37d789" facs="#m-391860b5-31a6-497f-a5f6-92b59ff4ab41" label="lyrics-like">pláceat Deo. Qui autem cum uxóre</l><l xml:id="m-dd41320b-5f40-4870-848e-d9451b023424" facs="#m-7018e5bf-5f96-4dfe-b327-c762acc4f468" label="lyrics-like">peccásti. Et si núpserit virgó, non</l><l xml:id="m-59fdfa54-a3d3-483a-9425-855437019991" facs="#m-569857a6-7234-4248-badd-bf7505fcb06a" label="lyrics-like">est, sollícitus est quae sunt mundi,</l><l xml:id="m-cd92e662-7b9e-4ad6-a5cf-7cf1da0b028b" facs="#m-74d75e76-1bdb-4fb8-817d-e7ea4cbfb4c0" label="lyrics-like">peccávit: tribulatiónem tamen car- quómodo pláceat uxóri, et divisus</l><l xml:id="m-0a63b103-d50b-4397-85f9-bb016f3e3d4d" facs="#m-3e08a541-0c7b-4924-8c67-78f4b408c847" label="lyrics-like">nis habébunt hujúsmodi. Ego au-lest. Et múlier innúpta, et virgo,</l><l xml:id="m-80334b6d-79b7-4e14-a36a-e7b6f68018bf" facs="#m-76460031-5358-486f-81f0-e80b49fe088b" label="lyrics-like">tem vobis parco. Hoc itaque dico, lcógitat quae Dómini sunt: ut sit</l><l xml:id="m-3a8cea4d-fb92-476f-a96d-f4b332319398" facs="#m-80a1be8b-6cc3-4ae3-9369-3185d72b0eb7" label="lyrics-like">fratres: Tempus breve est: réli- sancta córpore et spiritu : in Christo</l><l xml:id="m-a52c8f89-298e-4c2f-86d7-dae5d1bcfc8a" facs="#m-2964939d-f857-42d7-bf53-0f7e093303e7" label="lyrics-like">quum est, ut et qui habent uxóres,lJesu Dómino nostro.</l><l xml:id="m-9f6dd6a1-88eb-4660-911c-590aeee14475" facs="#m-c36a79af-8bd5-4bf0-ba24-f1bb154fce49" label="ambiguous">Grad.</l><l xml:id="m-2a045ede-2c62-4034-82b5-6ad22f5b87ad" facs="#m-453c8bff-f3ee-43fd-b463-e0375d8f7ea2" label="ambiguous">i.</l><l xml:id="m-71f9c233-fcb7-4b96-a82b-4ac7304c9fc5" facs="#m-663c2514-ac54-4c33-b04e-47dd34f0a707" label="lyrics-like">AOncu-pí¬</l><l xml:id="m-0c412c04-76b3-4507-9449-a5578deb1087" facs="#m-f7c18de2-ded2-4233-89ab-04d3b7165a9a" label="ambiguous">vit " rex</l><l xml:id="m-99b8d4d2-a990-4e54-a9cf-6805464c714c" facs="#m-207622a4-9224-467a-96da-9b8b8d82f4ee" label="lyrics-like">de- có¬</l><l xml:id="m-cc9715fb-62c7-4848-94a1-8b093d8fb071" facs="#m-fb0674d6-9a32-4ad9-ae1e-8af955783372" label="lyrics-like">est Dómi¬ nus</l><l xml:id="m-b6c410ea-fe06-4d0c-9862-8e6df795458c" facs="#m-da656997-27c8-4ca9-aac7-b93089e5cd55" label="lyrics-like">tú- um, quóni- am i-pse</l><l xml:id="m-770b4745-4dfa-4757-8e72-2531777a32e8" facs="#m-36388432-d0ee-485e-bf33-a98ff7b75480" label="ambiguous">rem</l><l xml:id="m-818ebde5-e775-41f4-8cfb-a7d4efb43acc" facs="#m-a2584893-97fe-4e15-ba89-60860a0f703a" label="ambiguous">W. Audi fi-li-a,</l><l xml:id="m-12d2a848-ff35-4b44-af3f-ebb3460424e9" facs="#m-d956bdff-543c-4524-9f83-b040f28a698f" label="lyrics-like">tú¬</l><l xml:id="m-1d44e6eb-08a3-4117-8651-19531e55ec66" facs="#m-b394804d-5001-4f00-97ca-4b88d9f76a5c" label="ambiguous">us.</l><l xml:id="m-ffae6497-c14a-4e75-8b99-c83f609d33a9" facs="#m-1f826942-0a14-4089-aeab-5a3f1722d934" label="lyrics-like">et inclí¬</l><l xml:id="m-5038f3ae-636d-4ec1-9dfd-ab6a750102ee" facs="#m-8b3f211e-15ec-44e4-ae73-c7d1bd1ed56c" label="ambiguous">et vide,</l><l xml:id="m-a42f61a4-85d4-4c76-bd81-6ea5f27526d2" facs="#m-c2d9f3c1-3f55-492a-8bbb-06cae6d0cae5" label="lyrics-like">na " áurem tú¬</l><l xml:id="m-be1d8a8c-13a7-4cf3-b4f9-f9f60da76837" facs="#m-ada8e104-da2d-4cb8-be6f-01945f2417a9" label="ambiguous">am.</l><l xml:id="m-1f4ad993-9cf4-4199-bc42-5db175da78c1" facs="#m-e16258cd-7360-4141-8c3d-534c8facbe5e" label="lyrics-like">Allelúia, allelúia. V. Haec est vírgo. p. 1222.</l><l xml:id="m-652a7200-d52f-431b-b421-68c9a2d642cf" facs="#m-f635d0a3-67b1-49ef-8dbc-0bd01be9ea45" label="text-like">After Septuagesima, the Alleluia. and its Verse are omitted. The Trad</l><l xml:id="m-4d426579-9748-4c0b-afab-3d35101de144" facs="#m-387c0b5c-9587-4576-a811-539d0c7696de" label="text-like">Andi filia. p. 1227, is said instead.</l><l xml:id="m-9b5f4095-d496-4d1b-b0be-5bc2cec8c2d7" facs="#m-239af2ed-1926-4251-b789-4d82d5094400" label="text-like">In Paschal Time, the Gradual is omitted. The Alleluia, alleltia. Y. Haec</l><l xml:id="m-f0ee2eca-5cac-4a09-86ab-4b43a01083e4" facs="#m-dbc56df2-5b57-48a8-b9ca-62a2257a2710" label="lyrics-like">est virgo. p. 1222, is sung instead, and then Alleltia. Y. O quam púlchra. p. 1223.</l><l xml:id="m-5fcac50f-4542-4592-aaf6-0bdb1153dc11" facs="#m-473e0c34-9d07-4d1c-9076-104960ebf712" label="lyrics-like">Gospel. Símile est regnum caelórum. p. 1223.</l><l xml:id="m-b8be6b75-c782-4a43-93ab-e56a9b73b9aa" facs="#m-cba01acd-3585-4a58-b2e9-a969db96d75b" label="lyrics-like">offertory. Afferéntur Régi. p. 1219.</l><l xml:id="m-c7dad18a-052a-438a-af2b-43d418db6f65" facs="#m-0b57ed00-493f-4304-a0f6-18557e622627" label="lyrics-like">Secret. Accépta tibi sit. D. 1228.</l></lg>
            </div>
          </section>
        </score>
      </mdiv>
    </body>
  </music>
</mei>